	(text "Block codes (sheet title blocks carry the same code):\n\n  M   RP2350B core, flash, crystal, buttons                    (sheet RP2350B)\n  PR  PSRAM U1 (CS = GPIO47)       LD  LEDs: LD2 blue GPIO20 (status), LD1 green (power)\n  HV  HDMI (mini-HDMI J6)          SD  micro SD J5 (SPI mode)\n  AU  TLV320DAC3100 codec, speaker J3 (JST-GH), headphones J4 (L/GND/R)\n  UC  native USB-C J8 (RP2350 USB, 5 V in)    PU  PIO-USB host USB-C J7\n  PW  power: polyfuse, Schottky, SY8089 3V3 buck, test points\n  HD  40-pin header J1: UART, SPI, I2C, GPIO (net names give the J1 pin); SWD on J2 (JST-SH, sheet RP2350B)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0fc499ab-888d-4303-bc62-aaff2ff84415")
	)
	(text "J1: Raspberry Pi 40-pin layout, pins mapped by function to RP2350B peripherals (net names give the J1 pin):\nI2C1 3/5 (GPIO10/11, shared with the codec), UART1 8/10 (GPIO8/9), SPI as Pi SPI0 19/21/23/24 = SPI1 TX/RX/SCK/CSn (GPIO43/40/42/41), CE1 26 (GPIO38).\nPCM/I2S 12/35/38/40: BCLK GPIO30, LRCLK GPIO31 (consecutive, for PIO I2S), DIN GPIO28, DOUT GPIO27.\nHAT ID EEPROM 27/28 = I2C0 SDA/SCL (GPIO36/37). 5V pins = VBUS rail, 3V3 pins = +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4f2670fc-574b-4da9-b318-f32e966477fa")
	)
	(text "GPIO map:\n\n  GPIO0-3    header 13/36/11/7            GPIO4-7    micro SD (SPI0)\n  GPIO8/9    UART1 TX/RX (header 8/10)    GPIO10/11  I2C1 SDA/SCL (header 3/5, codec)\n  GPIO12-19  HDMI TMDS (HSTX)             GPIO20     LD2 status LED\n  GPIO21/22  PIO-USB D+/D- (J7)           GPIO23-26  codec DIN/MCLK/BCLK/WCLK\n  GPIO27-46  header (SPI1 40-43 on 21/24/23/19, CE1 38 on 26, HAT ID 36/37 on 27/28)\n  GPIO47     PSRAM CS                     SWD on J2 (JST-SH)   HP L / GND / R on J4"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dfade4f2-0dcd-4787-aace-fa238f222ff1")
	)
